[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10080.309, "timestamp": "02:48:00", "text": "可以改进。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10083.11, "timestamp": "02:48:03", "text": "总有一天，总有一天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10090.469, "timestamp": "02:48:10", "text": "我的想法是，如果有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10093.91, "timestamp": "02:48:13", "text": "一种方法可以自动化我所有的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10097.429, "timestamp": "02:48:17", "text": "日常工作流程，那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10100.95, "timestamp": "02:48:20", "text": "对我来说就轻松多了，对吧？压力就小了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10103.19, "timestamp": "02:48:23", "text": "不用操心这些事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10106.79, "timestamp": "02:48:26", "text": "一切都会自动完成，对吧？太好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10108.55, "timestamp": "02:48:28", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10115.99, "timestamp": "02:48:35", "text": "哇。我敢打赌你总有一天会遇到瓶颈。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10126.389, "timestamp": "02:48:46", "text": "啊，我也不知道为什么一说到这些我就笑个不停"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10129.19, "timestamp": "02:48:49", "text": "，不过，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10131.91, "timestamp": "02:48:51", "text": "听起来确实有点无聊，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10136.309, "timestamp": "02:48:56", "text": "超级让人摸不着头脑。呃，因为现在的情况是，像我这样的人，我们往往会过度"}]